WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.088
You're good at the work.

00:00:02.471 --> 00:00:03.678
That was never the problem.

00:00:03.887 --> 00:00:05.571
You finish at six, and somebody still

00:00:05.629 --> 00:00:07.753
has to answer the comment, ring back

00:00:07.811 --> 00:00:09.797
whoever asked about pricing, and fill next

00:00:09.832 --> 00:00:10.702
week's diary.

00:00:11.027 --> 00:00:12.258
So it doesn't get done.

00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:13.547
Not because you're lazy.

00:00:13.872 --> 00:00:15.811
Because you already have a job.

00:00:16.461 --> 00:00:17.819
So we build the whole thing.

00:00:18.028 --> 00:00:20.362
We rebuilt BrightCover's website from scratch.

00:00:20.513 --> 00:00:22.579
Fast, works on a phone, every button

00:00:22.638 --> 00:00:24.460
doing one thing: book you in, or

00:00:24.518 --> 00:00:25.076
send the guide.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.817
And people reach you six ways.

00:00:26.991 --> 00:00:27.525
The site.

00:00:27.641 --> 00:00:28.814
A comment on a post.

00:00:28.884 --> 00:00:29.836
A direct message.

00:00:29.952 --> 00:00:30.753
A missed call.

00:00:30.869 --> 00:00:31.961
Your Google listing.

00:00:32.135 --> 00:00:33.586
Someone you already served.

00:00:33.911 --> 00:00:35.269
All of it lands in one place,

00:00:35.293 --> 00:00:36.674
with their name and where they've got

00:00:36.721 --> 00:00:37.023
to.

00:00:37.348 --> 00:00:39.728
One screen, everybody who ever asked.

00:00:40.378 --> 00:00:41.678
Then the part that gives you your

00:00:41.748 --> 00:00:42.561
evenings back.

00:00:42.944 --> 00:00:45.452
Someone comments, messages, texts, or opens the

00:00:45.498 --> 00:00:46.415
chat on your site.

00:00:46.543 --> 00:00:48.226
They get an answer in seconds.

00:00:48.609 --> 00:00:51.837
Facebook, Instagram, WhatsApp, text, the website.

00:00:52.116 --> 00:00:53.393
It offers them a time.

00:00:53.602 --> 00:00:55.134
And when someone asks a price, or

00:00:55.216 --> 00:00:57.456
anything regulated, it stops and passes it

00:00:57.503 --> 00:00:57.955
to you.

00:00:58.397 --> 00:01:00.347
That's the part most people skip.

00:01:00.997 --> 00:01:02.762
Being good is no use if nobody

00:01:02.797 --> 00:01:03.528
can find you.

00:01:03.911 --> 00:01:05.328
Three ways people look now.

00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:06.140
They search.

00:01:06.349 --> 00:01:07.766
They read the answer at the top.

00:01:08.207 --> 00:01:09.681
Or they ask their phone and take

00:01:09.739 --> 00:01:10.529
what it says.

00:01:10.854 --> 00:01:12.375
So we put her where those answers

00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:15.684
come from: Google across fifteen cities, Yelp,

00:01:15.718 --> 00:01:16.334
and Bing.

00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:18.737
Bing is what those assistants read.

00:01:19.387 --> 00:01:20.873
Then you need something to say.

00:01:21.117 --> 00:01:21.813
Every day.

00:01:22.057 --> 00:01:22.766
Forever.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.751
That's where most of this falls over.

00:01:25.076 --> 00:01:26.214
So we built that.

00:01:26.597 --> 00:01:27.642
She never stood in front of a

00:01:27.688 --> 00:01:28.211
camera.

00:01:28.385 --> 00:01:30.324
Fourteen films in two weeks.

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:32.425
Her face, her voice, a different room

00:01:32.495 --> 00:01:33.145
every time.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:35.873
Posting six times a day since, untouched,

00:01:36.048 --> 00:01:37.870
and it will carry twenty times that.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.227
Same machine, your words.

00:01:40.401 --> 00:01:42.642
A medspa fills next week's empty chairs.

00:01:42.758 --> 00:01:44.638
A salon rebooks before they leave.

00:01:44.755 --> 00:01:46.844
An accountant books January in November.

00:01:47.019 --> 00:01:48.725
A group home answers the nine o'clock

00:01:48.772 --> 00:01:49.190
call.

00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:51.512
A realtor, a caterer, a cleaner, a

00:01:51.628 --> 00:01:52.301
food truck.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.648
Give us twenty minutes.

00:01:53.857 --> 00:01:55.482
Let's give you your time back, while

00:01:55.517 --> 00:01:56.771
we grow your business.
